# Little Nightmares III (PPSA05143) — press past the title screen.
#
# The title screen composites at roughly t=110 s on a default launch and shows a
# "(X) Start" prompt bottom-right. These are wall-clock seconds ranges from the
# first pad poll; they are held for several seconds each because a range shorter
# than the interval between pad polls can be skipped entirely (tools/AGENTS.md).
#
# Run with PROSPER_PAD_SCRIPT_LOG=1 so the route reports the transitions it
# actually delivered — without that this route cannot tell "the guest ignored the
# input" from "the input was never applied".
120-124:cross
130-134:cross
142-146:cross
155-159:cross
170-174:cross
185-189:cross
205-209:cross
225-229:cross
